Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:29:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Kernel Manager: real GPU min/max range sliders + battery
 warning

GpuRangeGroup replaces the single freq-lock slider (GpuGroup) when the
kernel exposes both TYPE_GPU_MIN_FREQ and TYPE_GPU_MAX_FREQ controls
backed by the new axion_gpu_range limiter. Falls back to the old single
lock slider if only that is present (older kernel without the range
limiter). Adds a short battery-use warning below the sliders.

Change-Id: Id0111a94d85de09cc7a599054d0cc8560ec611f2
---
